    "title": "mpia",
    "version": "0.9.0",
    "description": "Documentation-only OpenAPI view of the mpia macOS data CLI. Paths are CLI subcommands, not HTTP routes; query parameters are CLI flags. Write-safety (dry-run/apply/confirmation) and exit codes are preserved as x-* extensions."
